WEBVTT

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.910
Where are you, Sir Kimblee?!

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.770
This is far from what you promised!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.500
You said your soldiers in Briggs would betray the others if we were to carry the attack to the fort!

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.800
Cease fire!

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.040
That was a crushing victory.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.930
Yeah.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.310
So this...

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:51.000
...is the bloody crest.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:21.510
We sigh whenever we're about to come to a standstill

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:21.510
Owarinaki tabi no tochuu tachidomarisouna toki

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:27.770
While moving on this endless journey.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:27.770
Fukai tameiki kobosu bokura wa

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:35.490
Everytime we lunge for it, it escapes and flies off.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:35.490
Tsukamikaketewa mata hanareteitta

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:42.910
But now, there's nothing to be afraid of

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:42.910
Demo ima wa mou nanimo osoreru koto wa nai

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:50.830
The powerful ties that bind our hearts

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:50.830
Kokoro wo tsunagu tsuyoi kizuna wa

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:56.300
Will never come loose.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:56.300
Keshite hodoke wa shinai sa

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:06.020
After a lifetime of searching, we finally arrived

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:06.020
Sagashitsuzukete tadoritsuita

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:11.810
Here, where the period lies.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:11.810
Kono basho de piriodo ni

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:21.110
Let's change all our sorrow and rage to power.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:21.110
Kanashimi ikari chikara ni kaete

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:26.040
Destiny is right within our reach.

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:26.040
Unmei wa sugu soba ni

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:36.090
So I'm saying...

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:40.170
...you're supposed to read the veins of the dragon while performing Eastern Alchemy!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.800
And I'm saying...

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.550
...I don't understand how!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.010
You're supposed to sharpen your senses!

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.180
Ready, go!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.470
See? I sense it!

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:50.060
I can't do that!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.440
Yes, you can!

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.270
Teach me the theories behind it!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.610
Things are real rowdy in there.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.150
I don't get it!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.530
Sorry for having to ask you to hide us here.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:58.990
Hey, don't worry about it.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.950
We're benefiting as well.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.530
Not the hair!

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:08.660
Now the kids have someone new to play with.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.920
Let Zampano know that we're going up to the mountains to collect firewood.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.050
Sure.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:19.920
Damn it!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.220
What a nightmare!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:27.970
Where the hell is Zampano?! Everyone else is working!

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.020
Yo!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.440
This way.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.690
Follow me.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.450
I'm counting on you, Zampano.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.470
Bite of the Ant

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.470
Bite of the Ant

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.960
So, you found out about Selim.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:56.750
Yes.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.750
And my identity, as well.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.050
Yes.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:09.470
How do you feel as a citizen of a country...

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.680
...to know that your leader and his son are both Homunculi?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:19.820
I believe it's a very sad thing for a family member you're supposed to trust to be fabricated.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:24.200
It's almost like you're playing house.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:27.320
All the while pretending to be human, creatures you deem as fools.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.330
As you say, he's my "son" given to me by my handlers.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:36.370
My rank of Führer President, along with my men and everything else, was also given to me.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.090
Rather than "house", I'd say it's more accurate to say we're playing "politics".

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:44.090
However, I picked my bride myself.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.720
Is the tea still not ready?

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.640
P-Pardon me.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.770
Delicious.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:11.080
Wow, so you used to be one of the head honchos of that Research Laboratory 5.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:15.330
I wouldn't say that. I just had a couple of people working under me.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.460
I wonder how they're doing now...

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:22.670
Hey!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.340
Who might that be?

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:31.760
He's a vagrant I met this morning.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.560
He wanted to have you see him, Doctor-

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.470
That's enough, Zampano.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.390
The shitty acting ends here.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.860
Why hello, Doctor.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:46.940
What might you be doing here?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:53.620
You're being too optimistic if you think roaches like you can outwit us.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.620
What the hell is this?!

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.620
Zampano!

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:05.420
The shitty acting ends here, right?!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:10.220
Our goal from the start was to lure you here!

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.050
Knowing how much of a nasty guy you are,

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:17.520
I figured you'd come and hunt me yourself if you knew I was alive!

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.810
What can three pieces of trash like you do?!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.480
No matter how many you've got on your side,
you're nothing but trash in the end-

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.820
They work like landmines.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.910
Alchemy evolves every day!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.870
There's no way alchemy like that can exist-

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.580
Dammit!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.130
If they're mines...

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:47.300
...all I have to do is trace your footsteps!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.130
How can this be?!

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:55.970
They were made to only react to Homunculi!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:01.390
You can't tell where they are and what awaits you because of all the snow.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:02.940
So, tell me.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:07.980
How does it feel to be ridiculed by people
you've been looking down on as trash and scum?

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.410
He's being fooled, all right.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.780
It's just remote alchemy.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:18.950
You bastards!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:24.330
You scum should obey our commands, just as you were meant to!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:28.670
You're nothing but trash! Don't get too cocky!

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:46.770
Doctor!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.360
That was close.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.740
Th-Thanks.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:59.450
Grr. You're pretty fast for a fatass.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.250
Don't underestimate trash!

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.750
You little shit!!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.920
Such weak attacks can hardly pierce my skin!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.430
Is that so?

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.260
Then what about this ?!

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.900
Did he do it?!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.740
Got you now!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:40.870
Doctor!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.540
Whoa, don't move.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.460
If you do, I'll snap him in half.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:45.960
Now...

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.380
...you're in for some punishment.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.710
Didn't I warn you, Doctor?

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.760
By saying I'll destroy an entire village if you were to do something unnecessary?

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.340
I won't let you!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.970
You're still going to resist?

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:05.390
Man, you're dumb.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.740
Okay, I'll destroy those slums over there.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.320
Stop!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.200
But simply destroying them is no fun.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:26.710
Perhaps I'll bring a few back to Central and make a philosopher's stone out of them.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.210
You filth!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.130
You're still making those things over at Central?!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.500
Release the researchers...

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.710
Release my men!

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.210
Huh?

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.800
That's impossible.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:41.300
Because you see, we've already turned all of them into philosopher's stones.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.020
E-Even my men?!

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:50.150
Oh? Guess I forgot to tell you, huh?

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:54.940
But Doctor, you shouldn't have any reason to weep now , after all this time.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:59.820
Since you've made so many philosopher's stones in the past.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.740
Using human lives.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.500
You're right.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:16.590
I've made many philosopher's stones, sacrificing the lives of many people.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:21.390
I am more familiar with the ways of making a
philosopher's stone than anyone else in this country.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.720
Knowing how to make one...

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.350
...also means I know how to destroy them!!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.460
What on earth is that?!

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.590
It's coming from the hill where the doctor and the others are!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.190
Oww! Oww!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:16.190
Oww! Oww! Ow! Ow!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.320
No...

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.360
It hurts!

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.400
This is...

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.950
No...

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:31.580
This-

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:33.330
This can't be...

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.830
I'm Envy...

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:40.300
There's no way I could be defeated by you inferior beings...

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.300
No...

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.760
Even the chimeras...

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.350
Don't look at me...

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.100
D-Don't look at-

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:51.350
Don't look down on me, humans!!!

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.520
Don't look at me, you insects...

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.900
Little shits...

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.280
Don't... look...

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:05.570
We were being manipulated by something like this ?

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.620
We won, Marcoh.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:22.260
They're back!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.300
Doctor Marcoh! What's with that wound?!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.180
What's that ?

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:41.110
Wow, so you guys were doing some amazing things without us knowing.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.320
This is what happens when you disobey us humans!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.830
Why did you do something so reckless, Doctor Marcoh?

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:54.580
All my life, I've been doing everything as ordered.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:58.790
But this was the one thing I wanted to settle myself.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:02.130
Thinking on my own... Making a decision on my own...

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.590
Just like your parents did things.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:11.100
But please, try not to be so reckless.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:12.970
Okay.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.100
Oww!!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.560
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.770
Sir Yoki?

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.190
H-Help me...

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.700
I've taken over this guy's body!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.740
Stop!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:31.410
You monster!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.490
M-My body isn't listening to me!

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:34.620
No use putting up a fight!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.370
Now, you trash!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.250
If you want to help this guy...

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.080
Nah, you can do whatever you want with him.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.960
He's not really our friend, anyway.

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:46.300
It's been a short while, Sir Yoki...

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.260
I'll never forget you!

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.050
Master Scar!

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:54.260
You're  on my side though, right?!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:54.850
Right?!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.850
Don't look away, dammit!!

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:03.520
I believed in you, Master!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.480
W-What? I thought this guy was your friend!

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.940
I believed in you!

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.780
Quit putting up a useless fight, Envy!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:10.280
At this point, we don't exactly care about our actions.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:13.780
If you're going to get in our way,
we'll destroy you along with that man!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:15.660
Dammit...

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.040
He came off.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:18.960
Really?

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.620
Nice act.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:25.380
I-I'm not very good at bluffs...

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.760
Damn you all!

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.840
None of you are my friends!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:30.800
Our friendship is over!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.140
I have nothing to do with you anymore!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.390
Damn...

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:40.520
So, it's about time you tell us what you guys are up to.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.980
Like I'll tell you.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.570
What did you say?!

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.230
Spill it!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.900
Spill the beans, you insect!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:47.650
Keep it up!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.610
Show him who's boss, Zampano!

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:55.580
If I tell you, I'll just be killed later!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.620
Why would I tell you, idiots?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.870
You son of a...

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:03.080
Oh yeah, where's the Fullmetal runt?

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.330
Brother?

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.460
He should be in Briggs right now.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.710
Oh?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.090
Last I heard, he was missing.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.010
What?!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.010
What do you mean?!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.010
Tell me more!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:18.680
I heard a mine collapsed in Baschool.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.390
I wonder if he's alive...

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.560
No way...

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.440
That can't be true.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.610
So, what should we do?

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.200
Should we head back to Baschool?

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.450
No.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.490
In a situation like this...

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:43.370
...Brother would definitely believe in the safety of the other team and keep moving forward.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.750
So I want to do the same.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.260
Hope is not lost.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.840
I'm going to split off for a bit.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.760
I've been thinking about it for a little while now.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.930
Instead of simply detesting this country for denying Ishbal...

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:03.690
...I'm going to work to change it.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:09.400
And for that, I need your help as well, Marcoh.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:12.990
Sure.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.030
I'll go with you.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.780
To change this country...

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:21.410
The thing is, there's a city I want to visit, as well.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.040
Where?

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.870
Lior.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.670
If my predictions are correct, that tunnel should be there, too.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:33.170
May, take this thing and return to your country.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:33.170
So I'm thinking it'll be fastest for us to just destroy that.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.430
Then, we'll be able to buy time.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.050
Hey, Master!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:38.470
It's the wreck of an immortal homunculus.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.720
With the extra time, we can solve the structure of the new transmutation circle.

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.220
With this, your clan may be saved.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:44.480
So, this "new transmutation circle" is the thing we discovered the other day, right?

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:45.230
B-But if I go back, who'll be here to help you with Eastern Alchemy-

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.060
Yup, that's the one.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.810
Is this really the time to be worrying about another country?!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.190
Did you come to this country with a resolve that weak?

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.730
If your clan happens to lose its struggle for power,

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:55.490
what are you going to tell the people who placed their fate in your hands?

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:59.490
"I failed because I was too busy helping people from another country"?!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:02.950
Go.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:06.960
We, the citizens of this country, will take care of it ourselves.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.220
Thank you... so much!

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.730
Take care, May.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:35.570
Once we settle things here, I'll visit you to learn more about Eastern Alchemy.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.280
Sir Al...

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.070
Sir Al!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.530
I... I...

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:51.290
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.300
Good bye!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.880
Take care!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.050
She's gone...

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:02.760
Yeah.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.270
Well then, we should get going, as well.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:05.890
Right.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.780
Mr. Greed...

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.210
No luck.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:37.550
Apparently, Izumi Curtis is out on vacation with her husband, and no one knows when they'll be back.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.760
Guess there's not much we can do.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.220
We should head back and report this to Führer President Bradley for now.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.520
Bradley?!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.480
You're coming with me, Greed.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.110
Call someone to take over.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.070
Good idea.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.110
I might be able to see Mr. Greed if I follow them...

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:04.870
But...

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.430
Umm...

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:30.020
Would you mind moving your foot, Sister?

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.100
You are to address me as "Major General" here!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.110
Aye, ma'am!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.860
You've got a cowardly face on as always, I see.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:42.820
I heard the battle with Drachma ended with your crushing victory.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.570
Of course!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.950
But wouldn't that just speed up the completion of the Nationwide Transmutation Circle?

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:50.000
It doesn't matter.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:54.620
What we must protect right now is the safety of the country itself.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.380
If there stands an enemy who threatens that very peace...

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:02.090
...our job is to deliver an overwhelming defeat of perfection!

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:05.260
Oh dear... why must you act so fierce?

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:08.010
At this rate, you'll never find someone to marry-

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.100
You just lack the fighting spirit!

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:14.020
You laggard!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.810
Being with you makes me feel cowardly as well!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.230
There you are, Major General.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:21.820
He's your brother, I take it?

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.700
I don't even want to think of him as my brother.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:28.330
He's a coward who ran away from Ishbal.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:30.790
Follow me.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.700
There's something I'd like to show you.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:40.590
Are you aware of the three laws state alchemists are forbidden to disobey?

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:41.920
If I recall...

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.550
"Do not oppose the military."

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.880
"Do not make gold."

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.430
And "Do not create humans."

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:48.600
Precisely.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:51.560
The first law is self-explanatory.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.600
The second law is put in place to avoid economic turmoil.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.400
Then what about the third?

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:02.610
Why does the nation forbid alchemists from creating humans?

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:04.610
I assume it's because of the moral and ethical implications.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:11.450
Even among alchemists, I hear the act is tacitly forbidden as a blasphemy to God.

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:14.330
You're wrong there.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:20.500
What is and is not ethical changes with time and also depends on whom you ask.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:25.590
That is not the reason.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:32.260
It is to prevent an individual from creating a powerful army of their own, Major General.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:50.490
The promise we never made

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:50.490
Kawashita hazu no nai yakasoku ga

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:51.280
yet again

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:51.280
Kyou mo

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:56.120
tries to snatch our future away from us.

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:56.120
Bokura no mirai wo ubaou to suru

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.710
Why is it that we can't rejoice

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.710
Hoshigatteita mono wo te ni shitemo

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:02.710
straight from the heart

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:02.710
Sunao ni

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:07.670
when we obtain something we've always been after?

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:07.670
Umaku waraenai nowa nazedarou

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:13.390
The overflowing tears aren't from feebleness or remorse.

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:13.390
Afureru namida wo yowasa ya koukai ja nai

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:18.180
They're fragments born from agony.

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:18.180
Itami ga unda kakera de

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:23.230
Of all the moments and destinies,

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:23.230
Donna shunkan datte unmei datte

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:31.990
I realized there's one absolute certainty.

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:31.990
Hitotsu dake tashika na mono ga aru to shitta

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:34.530
Even if things get tough and I'm at my limit

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:34.530
Genkai datte konnan datte

00:22:34.530 --> 00:22:38.540
I refuse to give up.

00:22:34.530 --> 00:22:38.540
Akirametakunaiyo

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:43.420
Please, don't let go.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:43.420
Konomama hanasanaide

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:51.260
I can feel the warmth of your right hand

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:51.260
Kataku nigirishimeta kimi no migite no nukumori

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:54.930
where it's tightly joined with my left.

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:54.930
Koko ni arukara

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:05.570
This place is in ruins...

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:08.280
Is there really a place to eat around here?

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:11.530
Let's see... I know it was around here somewhere...

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:14.820
Rose!

00:23:14.820 --> 00:23:15.990
How have you been?!

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:17.450
I should be asking you the same thing, Al!

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:19.580
What, you're still on a journey?

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:21.790
Oh, you know her?

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:24.080
Yeah, something like that.

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:26.090
Al, where's Ed?

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.340
He's not with you?

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:30.380
B-Brother isn't with us today.

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:33.720
Oh... that's too bad.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:35.390
I really wanted to see him.

00:23:38.100 --> 00:23:39.600
What's this?

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:41.180
Wh-What?!

00:23:41.180 --> 00:23:44.690
No, I was just pondering the meaning behind that mysterious look on your face.

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:46.400
Quit saying weird things!

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.230
Hey, Rose!

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:50.150
I finished washing the pots!

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:51.440
Is there anything else for me to-

00:23:59.660 --> 00:24:02.080
Reunion. Revival. Resolve.

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:04.790
The time has come to set the soul afire.

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:08.670
As long as they live, humans continue to move forward.

00:24:08.670 --> 00:24:12.170
No matter how thorny the path may be.

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:17.390
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:21.890
Episode 44, Revving at Full Throttle.

00:24:17.410 --> 00:24:21.910
Revving at Full Throttle

00:24:22.680 --> 00:24:24.020
Awaken, human.

00:24:24.020 --> 00:24:26.860
Now is the beginning.
